<title>UK: Svenska Handelsbanken adds $50 mln to FRN.</title>
<headline>Svenska Handelsbanken adds $50 mln to FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased to $300 million from $250 million, lead manager Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SVENSKA HANDELSBANKEN AB</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    24.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.058   FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    100.058</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINAL $250 MILLION LAUNCHED 11.JUN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
